  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        424.2572937011719,
        25.187198638916016,
        468.0633544921875,
        35.665069580078125
      ],
      "text": "Listening\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        38.271461486816406,
        58.879146575927734,
        128.00518798828125,
        68.3747787475586
      ],
      "text": "Questions 25-30\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        38.271461486816406,
        85.37480926513672,
        210.97393798828125,
        94.8703842163086
      ],
      "text": "Choose the correct letter, A, B or C.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        37.617252349853516,
        110.88914489746094,
        389.0441589355469,
        142.6315460205078
      ],
      "text": "25\nAdam suggests that restaurants could reduce obesity if their menus\nA __ offered fewer options.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        62.150264739990234,
        143.92694091796875,
        219.3249969482422,
        152.11279296875
      ],
      "text": "B\nhad more low-calorie foods.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.823143005371094,
        157.01116943359375,
        253.29835510253906,
        167.48910522460938
      ],
      "text": "C_\nwere organised in a particular way.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        37.29014587402344,
        176.96470642089844,
        333.7468566894531,
        187.77000427246094
      ],
      "text": "26\nThe students agree that food manufacturers deliberately\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.16893768310547,
        197.24530029296875,
        292.19940185546875,
        231.60032653808594
      ],
      "text": "A\nmake calorie counts hard to understand.\nB\nfail to provide accurate calorie counts.\nC\nuse ineffective methods to reduce calories.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        37.2901611328125,
        243.0402069091797,
        343.6580810546875,
        253.8455047607422
      ],
      "text": "27\nWhat does Rosie say about levels of exercise in England?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.16893768310547,
        262.99371337890625,
        297.18292236328125,
        271.50701904296875
      ],
      "text": "A\nThe amount recommended is much too low.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.49604034423828,
        276.0780029296875,
        307.6928405761719,
        299.6404724121094
      ],
      "text": "B-\nMost people overestimate how much they do.\nC\nWomen now exercise more than they used to.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        37.29014587402344,
        308.7886657714844,
        420.93707275390625,
        317.6293640136719
      ],
      "text": "28\nAdam refers to the location and width of stairs in a train station to illustrate\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.168922424316406,
        327.7608642578125,
        355.89190673828125,
        352.6317443847656
      ],
      "text": "A _\npractical changes that can influence people’s behaviour.\nB_\nmethods of helping people who have mobility problems.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.496009826660156,
        354.91070556640625,
        382.9975280761719,
        365.71600341796875
      ],
      "text": "C_\nways of preventing accidents by controlling crowd movement.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        37.29011535644531,
        374.5370788574219,
        414.9183044433594,
        385.6698303222656
      ],
      "text": "29\nWhat do the students agree about including reference to exercise in their\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.823097229003906,
        387.9484558105469,
        127.0759048461914,
        398.098876953125
      ],
      "text": "presentation?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.168888092041016,
        406.5935363769531,
        264.1843566894531,
        431.1369934082031
      ],
      "text": "A__ They should probably leave it out.\nB_\nThey need to do more research on it.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.49597930908203,
        433.7433776855469,
        278.0536804199219,
        444.2212829589844
      ],
      "text": "C_\nThey should discuss this with their tutor.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        37.29010009765625,
        453.6968994140625,
        358.99456787109375,
        464.502197265625
      ],
      "text": "30\nWhat are the students going to do next for their presentation?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        60.84177017211914,
        473.650390625,
        268.73773193359375,
        510.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "A\nprepare some slides for it\nB _ find out how long they have for it\nC_\ndecide on its content and organisation\n"
    },
    {
